  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OCHA f&#xe4;lt samordning 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s support to OCHA for humanitarian field coordination during     2010-2013 (335 MSEK: 70 MSEK for 2010, 80 MSEK for 2011, and twice 90 MSEK for following years). support in 2010 will reinforce 17 country  offices and includes 14 MSEK in un-allocated funding that OCHA may    use in consultation with Sida for under-funded offices. Annual        dialogue will determine distribution of funding in 2011, 2012 and -13</narrative>
  </description>
